  "prefLabel": "Plc 902.09 Hydrotherapy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 902.09 “Hydrotherapy” means the application of water in its varied forms, such as solid, liquid, or vapor, to the body for therapeutic effects.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
